skill.prompt_template:
Inspect the Docker container(s) matching: {container_identifier}
Inspection scope: {inspection_scope}
Required information: - Container state and status - Configuration (image, command, entrypoint, environment variables) - Network settings (IP addresses, ports, networks) - Mounts and volumes - Resource limits and usage (if available) - Health check status (if configured)
Context: {context}
Error handling: - If container not found: report clearly with suggested alternatives - If multiple containers match: list all matches with brief summary - If Docker daemon unavailable: report daemon status and suggest troubleshooting
Output format: Structured summary with key-value pairs for each inspection category.
